================================================================================
1. lavalink-client (TypeScript)  --  MIT
   https://github.com/bongo-devs/lavalink-client
================================================================================

Data ported, not code:

  - lavalink/filters.go: the equalizer band tables (EQBassboostEarrape,
    EQBassboostHigh, EQBassboostMedium, EQBassboostLow, EQBetterMusic,
    EQFullSound, EQRock, EQClassic, EQPop, EQElectronic, EQGaming), ported from
    EQList, and the Nightcore and Vaporwave timescale values.
  - search.go: the sourceAliases table of search-source shorthands.

gurulink is a from-scratch Go implementation and reproduces no TypeScript from
that project; the feature set was modelled on it. The MIT license requires its
notice to accompany the ported portions, so it follows in full:

